{"page":31,"width":1908,"height":2901,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"1.4 운영체제의작동 27","words":[{"text":"1.4","x":1313,"y":189,"width":53,"height":24},{"text":"운영체제의작동","x":1382,"y":189,"width":185,"height":29},{"text":"27","x":1645,"y":183,"width":42,"height":31}]},{"text":"-구. 운영체제가 김퓨터의 제어를 얻을 때마다 항상 커널 모드에 있게 된다. 시스템은 사","words":[{"text":"-구.","x":322,"y":334,"width":32,"height":31},{"text":"운영체제가","x":369,"y":329,"width":171,"height":41},{"text":"김퓨터의","x":558,"y":331,"width":129,"height":40},{"text":"제어를","x":707,"y":331,"width":100,"height":40},{"text":"얻을","x":825,"y":330,"width":66,"height":40},{"text":"때마다","x":908,"y":330,"width":104,"height":41},{"text":"항상","x":1026,"y":330,"width":70,"height":41},{"text":"커널","x":1112,"y":329,"width":65,"height":41},{"text":"모드에","x":1194,"y":330,"width":102,"height":40},{"text":"있게","x":1317,"y":330,"width":64,"height":41},{"text":"된다.","x":1401,"y":331,"width":77,"height":40},{"text":"시스템은","x":1497,"y":330,"width":141,"height":40},{"text":"사","x":1653,"y":332,"width":37,"height":40}]},{"text":"용자 프로그램으로 제어를 넘기기 전에 항상 사용자 모드(모드 비트를 1로 설정)로 전","words":[{"text":"용자","x":322,"y":396,"width":68,"height":40},{"text":"프로그램으로","x":406,"y":397,"width":202,"height":38},{"text":"제어를","x":626,"y":397,"width":101,"height":40},{"text":"넘기기","x":745,"y":397,"width":96,"height":40},{"text":"전에","x":864,"y":397,"width":63,"height":40},{"text":"항상","x":947,"y":397,"width":71,"height":41},{"text":"사용자","x":1033,"y":397,"width":105,"height":41},{"text":"모드(모드","x":1154,"y":401,"width":152,"height":39},{"text":"비트를","x":1324,"y":398,"width":105,"height":40},{"text":"1로","x":1445,"y":402,"width":55,"height":31},{"text":"설정)로","x":1518,"y":398,"width":119,"height":42},{"text":"전","x":1656,"y":398,"width":32,"height":39}]},{"text":"한한다.","words":[{"text":"한한다.","x":323,"y":462,"width":108,"height":40}]},{"text":"동작의 이중 모드는 잘못된 사용자로부터 운영체제를, 그리고 잘못된 싸우자 서로","words":[{"text":"동작의","x":387,"y":529,"width":97,"height":39},{"text":"이중","x":506,"y":529,"width":66,"height":39},{"text":"모드는","x":589,"y":532,"width":101,"height":36},{"text":"잘못된","x":707,"y":530,"width":100,"height":40},{"text":"사용자로부터","x":825,"y":531,"width":202,"height":40},{"text":"운영체제를,","x":1049,"y":531,"width":181,"height":42},{"text":"그리고","x":1250,"y":532,"width":104,"height":40},{"text":"잘못된","x":1372,"y":532,"width":104,"height":40},{"text":"싸우자","x":1494,"y":530,"width":109,"height":41},{"text":"서로","x":1621,"y":531,"width":70,"height":40}]},{"text":"를 보호하는 방법을 우리에게 제공한다. 우리는 악영향을 끼질 수 있는 일부 명령을 특","words":[{"text":"를","x":324,"y":597,"width":33,"height":38},{"text":"보호하는","x":373,"y":595,"width":134,"height":39},{"text":"방법을","x":524,"y":595,"width":100,"height":40},{"text":"우리에게","x":639,"y":597,"width":132,"height":40},{"text":"제공한다.","x":791,"y":597,"width":142,"height":41},{"text":"우리는","x":952,"y":599,"width":104,"height":41},{"text":"악영향을","x":1072,"y":599,"width":138,"height":40},{"text":"끼질","x":1227,"y":599,"width":64,"height":41},{"text":"수","x":1309,"y":600,"width":35,"height":39},{"text":"있는","x":1362,"y":600,"width":69,"height":39},{"text":"일부","x":1448,"y":599,"width":68,"height":39},{"text":"명령을","x":1534,"y":598,"width":106,"height":40},{"text":"특","x":1654,"y":601,"width":37,"height":38}]},{"text":"권 명령(privileged instruction)으로 지정함으로써 이러한 보호를 달성한다. 하드웨어","words":[{"text":"권","x":325,"y":664,"width":32,"height":38},{"text":"명령(privileged","x":372,"y":663,"width":255,"height":46},{"text":"instruction)으로","x":643,"y":667,"width":269,"height":41},{"text":"지정함으로써","x":928,"y":666,"width":201,"height":40},{"text":"이러한","x":1148,"y":666,"width":103,"height":40},{"text":"보호를","x":1263,"y":668,"width":105,"height":37},{"text":"달성한다.","x":1381,"y":666,"width":149,"height":40},{"text":"하드웨어","x":1547,"y":665,"width":139,"height":42}]},{"text":"는 특권 명령이 커널 모드에서만 수행되도록 허용한다. 사용자 모드에서 특권 명령을 수","words":[{"text":"는","x":324,"y":732,"width":34,"height":36},{"text":"특권","x":370,"y":729,"width":68,"height":39},{"text":"명령이","x":453,"y":729,"width":96,"height":40},{"text":"커널","x":568,"y":730,"width":64,"height":39},{"text":"모드에서만","x":648,"y":731,"width":170,"height":40},{"text":"수행되도록","x":831,"y":732,"width":172,"height":40},{"text":"허용한다.","x":1018,"y":733,"width":143,"height":40},{"text":"사용자","x":1178,"y":733,"width":104,"height":40},{"text":"모드에서","x":1294,"y":733,"width":137,"height":39},{"text":"특권","x":1448,"y":733,"width":71,"height":39},{"text":"명령을","x":1535,"y":733,"width":105,"height":40},{"text":"수","x":1653,"y":734,"width":37,"height":39}]},{"text":"행하려고 시도하면, 하드웨어는 이를 실행하지 않괴 불법적인 명령으로 간주해 운영체","words":[{"text":"행하려고","x":326,"y":796,"width":133,"height":40},{"text":"시도하면,","x":475,"y":796,"width":144,"height":41},{"text":"하드웨어는","x":636,"y":798,"width":171,"height":40},{"text":"이를","x":823,"y":800,"width":67,"height":39},{"text":"실행하지","x":906,"y":800,"width":132,"height":40},{"text":"않괴","x":1058,"y":800,"width":77,"height":40},{"text":"불법적인","x":1151,"y":800,"width":137,"height":40},{"text":"명령으로","x":1307,"y":800,"width":138,"height":40},{"text":"간주해","x":1461,"y":800,"width":104,"height":40},{"text":"운영체","x":1582,"y":801,"width":104,"height":40}]},{"text":"제로 트랩을 건다.","words":[{"text":"제로","x":326,"y":864,"width":66,"height":39},{"text":"트랩을","x":404,"y":862,"width":102,"height":39},{"text":"건다.","x":520,"y":863,"width":73,"height":40}]},{"text":"커널 모드로 전환하는 명령어가 특권 명령어의 예이다. 다른 예로는 I/O 제어, 타이","words":[{"text":"커널","x":390,"y":929,"width":62,"height":39},{"text":"모드로","x":467,"y":934,"width":102,"height":29},{"text":"전환하는","x":584,"y":931,"width":136,"height":39},{"text":"명령어가","x":734,"y":931,"width":136,"height":40},{"text":"특권","x":882,"y":933,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"명령어의","x":966,"y":933,"width":132,"height":39},{"text":"예이다.","x":1116,"y":933,"width":110,"height":39},{"text":"다른","x":1241,"y":933,"width":70,"height":39},{"text":"예로는","x":1325,"y":933,"width":105,"height":40},{"text":"I/O","x":1441,"y":936,"width":70,"height":36},{"text":"제어,","x":1526,"y":934,"width":79,"height":39},{"text":"타이","x":1620,"y":934,"width":66,"height":39}]},{"text":"머 관리 및 인터럽트 관리가 있다. 이 책 전반에 걸쳐 많은 다른 특권 명령이 논의된다.","words":[{"text":"머","x":326,"y":996,"width":28,"height":40},{"text":"관리","x":370,"y":996,"width":63,"height":39},{"text":"및","x":451,"y":996,"width":29,"height":39},{"text":"인터럽트","x":497,"y":997,"width":134,"height":39},{"text":"관리가","x":643,"y":997,"width":105,"height":40},{"text":"있다.","x":762,"y":997,"width":73,"height":40},{"text":"이","x":852,"y":998,"width":28,"height":39},{"text":"책","x":898,"y":998,"width":29,"height":39},{"text":"전반에","x":945,"y":999,"width":98,"height":39},{"text":"걸쳐","x":1060,"y":999,"width":63,"height":39},{"text":"많은","x":1141,"y":999,"width":70,"height":39},{"text":"다른","x":1222,"y":999,"width":69,"height":39},{"text":"특권","x":1303,"y":1000,"width":70,"height":38},{"text":"명령이","x":1388,"y":999,"width":100,"height":39},{"text":"논의된다.","x":1504,"y":1000,"width":150,"height":38}]},{"text":"모드의 개념은 두 가지 모드 이상으로 확장될 수 있다. 예를 들어, lntel 프로세서에","words":[{"text":"모드의","x":387,"y":1063,"width":98,"height":39},{"text":"개념은","x":503,"y":1063,"width":101,"height":40},{"text":"두","x":617,"y":1066,"width":35,"height":37},{"text":"가지","x":667,"y":1064,"width":63,"height":39},{"text":"모드","x":748,"y":1068,"width":69,"height":28},{"text":"이상으로","x":833,"y":1064,"width":137,"height":39},{"text":"확장될","x":982,"y":1064,"width":103,"height":39},{"text":"수","x":1100,"y":1065,"width":35,"height":38},{"text":"있다.","x":1151,"y":1065,"width":74,"height":39},{"text":"예를","x":1243,"y":1064,"width":68,"height":39},{"text":"들어,","x":1324,"y":1065,"width":80,"height":39},{"text":"lntel","x":1418,"y":1068,"width":82,"height":32},{"text":"프로세서에","x":1515,"y":1065,"width":174,"height":39}]},{"text":"는 4개의 분리된 보호 링이 있다. 여기서 링 0은 커널 모드이고 링 3은 사용자 모드이다.","words":[{"text":"는","x":324,"y":1131,"width":35,"height":36},{"text":"4개의","x":370,"y":1129,"width":83,"height":39},{"text":"분리된","x":469,"y":1129,"width":101,"height":39},{"text":"보호","x":584,"y":1132,"width":69,"height":32},{"text":"링이","x":668,"y":1129,"width":63,"height":40},{"text":"있다.","x":751,"y":1129,"width":73,"height":39},{"text":"여기서","x":842,"y":1129,"width":97,"height":40},{"text":"링","x":960,"y":1130,"width":27,"height":39},{"text":"0은","x":1004,"y":1131,"width":56,"height":37},{"text":"커널","x":1074,"y":1130,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"모드이고","x":1155,"y":1130,"width":138,"height":40},{"text":"링","x":1309,"y":1131,"width":28,"height":38},{"text":"3은","x":1354,"y":1131,"width":57,"height":37},{"text":"사용자","x":1423,"y":1131,"width":107,"height":39},{"text":"모드이다.","x":1543,"y":1130,"width":148,"height":38}]},{"text":"(링 1과 2는 다양한 운영체제 서비스에 사용될 수 있지만 실제로는 거의 A卜\u0026되지 않는","words":[{"text":"(링","x":325,"y":1195,"width":41,"height":43},{"text":"1과","x":386,"y":1195,"width":52,"height":40},{"text":"2는","x":451,"y":1197,"width":53,"height":36},{"text":"다양한","x":519,"y":1195,"width":103,"height":40},{"text":"운영체제","x":634,"y":1195,"width":136,"height":39},{"text":"서비스에","x":789,"y":1195,"width":135,"height":40},{"text":"사용될","x":941,"y":1196,"width":103,"height":39},{"text":"수","x":1060,"y":1196,"width":36,"height":39},{"text":"있지만","x":1112,"y":1197,"width":104,"height":39},{"text":"실제로는","x":1229,"y":1197,"width":139,"height":39},{"text":"거의","x":1384,"y":1197,"width":65,"height":39},{"text":"A卜\u0026되지","x":1467,"y":1196,"width":138,"height":39},{"text":"않는","x":1625,"y":1195,"width":69,"height":40}]},{"text":"다.) ARMv8 시스템에는 7가지 모드가 있다. 가상화를 지원하는 CPU (18.1절)는 종종","words":[{"text":"다.)","x":325,"y":1261,"width":53,"height":42},{"text":"ARMv8","x":392,"y":1265,"width":133,"height":31},{"text":"시스템에는","x":541,"y":1261,"width":172,"height":40},{"text":"7가지","x":726,"y":1261,"width":85,"height":40},{"text":"모드가","x":828,"y":1261,"width":106,"height":40},{"text":"있다.","x":948,"y":1261,"width":75,"height":40},{"text":"가상화를","x":1040,"y":1262,"width":139,"height":40},{"text":"지원하는","x":1193,"y":1263,"width":138,"height":39},{